00:43:16.550 --> 00:43:34.129
Samuel Smith: In general, so using a SED means that it's a cryptographic commitment to the media type, so if you reference the SED, then nobody can… nobody can play games with the media. They can't change any bits in the media and still have it be the same media with the same SED.

